# 8. AI Rules

AI MAY

Explain

Summarize

Translate

Analyze trends

Read documents

Generate routines

Answer care questions

AI MUST consider:
- Cat age/life stage
- Weight
- Relevant medical history
- Current medications
- Recent symptoms
- Kitten-specific requirements where applicable

AI MUST NOT give generic adult-cat advice to kittens when age-specific guidance is relevant.

AI MUST NOT

Diagnose disease

Prescribe medicine

Change dosage

Replace veterinarians

---


